    "k": 2,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Questions six to ten are based on part two of the interview.",
    "zh": "第6至10题根据访谈的第二部分提问。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be based on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen004.png",
    "sha256": "85b66c78fd377cb5f62139f78b63874bdd4e887b7edf45f4b16f4d301685472a",
    "k": 3,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now, Jim, you said a gap year can be just a few months?",
    "zh": "吉姆，您刚才说，间隔年也可以只有几个月？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "gap year"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen005.png",
    "sha256": "560a466f133f618e44e133d954e3f56f1bdc1228f47343e9159496b5864c8727",
    "k": 4,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So what if people don’t want to take a whole year out?",
    "zh": "那如果有人不想拿出整整一年呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "take a whole year out"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen006.png",
    "sha256": "7abe97e1dacf48435b0e1d16d842c7609b28c26e26c751d25abcd011e1fb65ce",
    "k": 5,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, everyone gets confused when you say gap year. They’re like, “What? It’s a whole year?” No, it’s not.",
    "zh": "一说到间隔年，大家就容易误解。他们会说：“什么？是整整一年吗？”不，不是的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "get confused"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen007.png",
    "sha256": "12634b3d88927bb222277ed774ebb33bf0e1da42fe33561f1cbbf6995026a6f2",
    "k": 6,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "A gap year is just time-out between life stages.",
    "zh": "间隔年只是人生两个阶段之间的一段暂歇。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "time-out",
      "life stages"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen008.png",
    "sha256": "a67b64fa36a80ccd41895d421146f2d46b1861f2a6321e2fdf610b50a2dbcd79",
    "k": 7,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "People from all ages and all backgrounds take a gap year.",
    "zh": "各个年龄、各种背景的人都可以过间隔年。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "background"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen009.png",
    "sha256": "b7e4126084fb4d59d01d31a0aaea8599bddd6ca2c12e3870b27ec50afcd59a8e",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "You know, and the majority of this time, I’d say it’s usually only for three to nine months?",
    "zh": "而且，大多数时候，我想通常也就三到九个月。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "majority",
      "three to nine months"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen010.png",
    "sha256": "5a5e67f58ece038c4b4227e868213b9d3484c0908125480d12aeb2b5d1f058d8",
    "k": 9,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Anyway, back to the question. If people only want to travel for a month or so, then there are a number of short gap options.",
    "zh": "总之，回到刚才的问题。如果只想旅行一个月左右，也有很多短期的间隔年方案可选。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "option"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "9bba7e3fe1baf6156688ae030916a188e6eba5bc0302c7c7c512818b825de627",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "For example, they can travel around China or Southeast Asia, taking in the sights.",
    "zh": "例如，可以环游中国或东南亚，欣赏各地风景。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "take in the sights"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "1b1b46f8fdda602b9afdb7a8440edecf5713c578fa305a74a73c00e52386f1b3",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "They can volunteer in South America, and they can go on an overland tour in Africa.",
    "zh": "可以去南美洲做志愿者，也可以在非洲进行陆路旅行。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "volunteer",
      "overland tour"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "5f22bcba7cc6a9c6796a48624fb010563975c83aa5d4a8f47bb56c9d7e4c8590",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "There are endless opportunities out there.",
    "zh": "机会多得数不清。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "endless",
      "opportunity"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "759f173048e4e027505ec9f3097b1fd7bdcb889e35997933af46f5f8eca30ff5",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "All you need to do is decide what it is you want to see and do.",
    "zh": "你只需要决定自己想看什么、做什么。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "decide"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "78ceae50212a1522127387e3aefa39e07753e27d841e8c88e86d7eebe86688ab",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Short gaps are like ultra-concentrated gap years.",
    "zh": "短期间隔年就像高度浓缩版的间隔年。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "ultra-concentrated"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "ca52ebf81891fed83c891e9103a5d1528c78ef4aec5796196e53e37078994ea6",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now, another question. You yourself travelled and volunteered in your gap year, so why is that a good option?",
    "zh": "接下来还有一个问题。您在自己的间隔年中既旅行又做志愿者，为什么这是一个好选择？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "volunteer",
      "option"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "5a5f0cde42512be58f7c4d78f46b4a3f277fe8722c3899ca19bf520e6495b7d1",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Because you’re not only making a direct difference to local people’s lives, but you’re also learning more about a specific culture and society.",
    "zh": "因为你不仅直接改变了当地人的生活，也能更深入地了解某个地区特有的文化和社会。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "make a direct difference",
      "specific"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "0304232861f0f31db4df70e2763111a307f3eff157d571942ef6a3dd58687ee3",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Often, you can learn a lot more about an area volunteering than just travelling around.",
    "zh": "通常，相比单纯四处旅行，做志愿者能让你对一个地方有更深入的了解。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "volunteer"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "93aa0127ea6776a2cd5e021a8eb1de6a6b6a57ccd8838b48ee74d5c01fe5532b",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We’d love to find out what is on people’s travel list. Could you tell us yours?",
    "zh": "我们很想知道大家的旅行愿望清单上都有什么。您能说说自己的吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "travel list"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "0bdb407f296de82d70be2c250f079ba1232a9536de602ea2c119234f23c5ce57",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I think a travel list has to be as ridiculous as possible.",
    "zh": "我觉得，旅行愿望清单就应该尽可能天马行空。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "ridiculous"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "e1e94ae3a9a2ac1e5146577610c28fc7f2391c2906ed1bf5d0ed3373be4aa366",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It has to be made up of things that are achievable and things that are perhaps unachievable.",
    "zh": "其中既要有能够实现的事情，也要有一些或许实现不了的事情。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be made up of",
      "achievable",
      "unachievable"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "5fb6b0808a4b5862da1093438952732487834952d0cc65adb7c99533f598a1c7",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "After all, what do you do when you’ve done everything.",
    "zh": "毕竟，如果所有事情都做完了，你接下来还能做什么呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "After all"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "d40ffe4aa9fa5adc92dd3d0f43ca145ac0856f9c87cd96e70a58990352ebf8e8",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 4,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Ah... on my travel list, number one, cage diving with great white sharks; ",
    "zh": "我的旅行清单上，第一项是在防护笼里潜水，近距离接触大白鲨；",
    "vocabulary": [
      "cage diving"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "b3c8a3d2f49715840f35bebe0cde7499d9a775d6842939350809f76c6a23615c",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 4,
    "role": null,
    "en": "number two, hitchhiking across America from New York to San Francisco; ",
    "zh": "第二项是搭便车横穿美国，从纽约到旧金山；",
    "vocabulary": [
      "hitchhike"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "c45cf5d53fa30dcd1f6b116b5c011ed7eeed7d5e876fd4f430c8d74d47b85e35",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 3,
    "parts": 4,
    "role": null,
    "en": "number three, touring overland in Africa, ",
    "zh": "第三项是在非洲进行陆路旅行；",
    "vocabulary": [
      "overland"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "3d993cff3582e4106364e9f557cd5c20d1839e628db58e1a584c30cb0a8e97fa",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 4,
    "parts": 4,
    "role": null,
    "en": "and number four is climbing Mount Qomolangma, which, let’s be honest, I need to think twice.",
    "zh": "第四项是攀登珠穆朗玛峰，不过说实话，这一项我得三思。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Mount Qomolangma",
      "think twice"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "49b94306d9ecfedbe8af741b57d90e9ff56a046a59373bb5f0580ea7fff66ac4",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, Jim, you’ve travelled a huge amount for somebody who is only 26 years old.",
    "zh": "吉姆，您才26岁，却已经去过这么多地方了。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "travel"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "6b2334d3a043abe9bd2d50b72112734e0b32f9938b8daa7ede681236abd9d74f",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I’m curious, how did you get the travel bug?",
    "zh": "我很好奇，您是怎么迷上旅行的？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "get the travel bug"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "70493b01fadc600c29d4539d3fd09f86bf5b04df9b53c38ae7e347c51589680d",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, firstly, I grew up in an international household with a German mother and an Italian-American father, ",
    "zh": "首先，我在一个国际化家庭里长大，母亲是德国人，父亲是意大利裔美国人，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "household",
      "Italian-American"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "c9a27d44e53f5b1225ee2293112647449d94d2e12652867aeacb03a0143a6199",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "so our daily lives and conversations always were more global in a lot of ways.",
    "zh": "因此我们的日常生活和交谈，在很多方面都更具全球视野。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "global"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "384e4aa2fc6d080dba49e6663461a80a7644f332791527808784e316ed5c6ac1",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Thus, I always saw the world as small and attainable.",
    "zh": "所以，在我眼中，世界一直既小又触手可及。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "attainable"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "388dd86bfc1079ece1e4c949a6fb349f52cefe340283a38a1708ff2062b390f3",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Secondly, when I was 16, I left home to go to the United World College, ",
    "zh": "其次，16岁时，我离家去了世界联合学院；",
    "vocabulary": [
      "United World College"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "a5327682f89cc9341b8ae21659a3ba6e91aec398623813758f98f012dca918ff",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "which is a two-year boarding school with students from 90 different countries.",
    "zh": "那是一所学制两年的寄宿学校，学生来自90个不同国家。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "boarding school"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "35f020e3a56dc863a18f920512e29c545ae72247d57c056729030bdb683cf58a",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "There, I really grew to see the entire world as an interconnected place, ",
    "zh": "在那里，我真正开始把整个世界看成相互联系的整体；",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interconnected"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "b07a3904f4cc674dbf80673740d126ecc1da6f517d09982c85c786b1e3faf38f",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "and began to think of myself less with national identities and more through global and human lenses.",
    "zh": "我不再主要以国籍来定位自己，而是更多地从全球和人类整体的视角看待自己。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "national identities",
      "lens"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "66bc513baaf8314b1cd32f59d09a4c8707f64371f51bdf708fc6f8cd68e03f87",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "These two things really explain my love for the world and help to explain my love for travel, I guess.",
    "zh": "我想，这两件事确实能解释我为何热爱这个世界，也能解释我为何热爱旅行。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "explain",
      "love for travel"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "9346f873eed3ef008e2ff82160b2b0fa6c5db9163016cbafb237e39fb84da28a",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Oh, I see. And what will visiting every country in the world mean to you, personally?",
    "zh": "噢，我明白了。那么，对您个人来说，走遍世界上每一个国家意味着什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "5d6ccb8f4c15d4b5b4d5130ed4240cbd5576a8e3636281796cbb73dcc7e58151",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "For me, it'll be about how much I’ve learned.",
    "zh": "对我来说，关键是看自己学到了多少。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "learn"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "a3cfc1482d32487db4134803baf642021cad02f1f94e8e9c661ef548eacfa98d",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It will be a validation of my ability to think critically and analyze the different ways that societies try to function.",
    "zh": "这会检验我能否批判性地思考，并分析不同社会努力运作的各种方式。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "validation",
      "critically",
      "function"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "cf74e191dd9774dc3b18f8d3a767a06bd4bfabd8ab390c755df3951b11804b0b",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "There’s so much to learn from personal experience of being in a place.",
    "zh": "身处某个地方的亲身经历中，有太多值得学习的东西。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "personal experience"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "09d2b088ed60edec7a9e5e3d577a23c04a129c6a6d979af840328cf5a34f3809",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "And I love travel, because to me, it’s about constant learning.",
    "zh": "我热爱旅行，因为对我而言，旅行意味着不断学习。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "constant learning"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "98d1c605eb5da77252b5fc0879fd5a22c889a07e0f3253c36004d05bf956dace",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yeah, “Travel broadens one’s mind,” as the saying goes.",
    "zh": "正如那句俗话说的：“旅行开阔眼界。”",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Travel broadens one’s mind"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "a987ad80f796e9c75e37492cb7fba8dfc55ff0eebd7be37b5ca9d9dd44dc2eea",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, Jim, thank you very much for joining us on the interview.",
    "zh": "吉姆，非常感谢您参加我们的访谈。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "join somebody"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "6eecee08b7ba8a9a3b9557ef759c35f036e8773762ff05f9d8554fb372aafffe",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "My pleasure.",
    "zh": "我的荣幸。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "My pleasure"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "72e31fdb0d7ef12972789ac63de88322b559a0b93a9a4408df0f1d558432b69f",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "This is the end of part two of the interview.",
    "zh": "访谈的第二部分到此结束。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "end"
    ]
  },
  {
